.TH devin-plugins-prune 1  "prune " 
.SH NAME
devin\-plugins\-prune \- Prune plugin requirements from repos that no longer exist on disk, then garbage\-collect any plugin content no live scope still requires
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin plugins prune\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prune plugin requirements from repos that no longer exist on disk, then garbage\-collect any plugin content no live scope still requires
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
